{
  "douvras": {
    "id": "gemma-2-9b",
    "family": "gemma",
    "version_label": "2-9B",
    "release_date": "2024-06-27",
    "license": "gemma",
    "published_params": 9241705984,
    "hf_repo": "google/gemma-2-9b",
    "source_url": "https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-2-9b/resolve/main/config.json",
    "provenance": "TRANSCRIBED_UNVERIFIED",
    "sha256": null,
    "note": "Contraexemplo estrutural do corpus: 4 normalizacoes por camada, head_dim 256 com h*head_dim != hidden, embeddings amarrados, GeGLU, softcapping de logits e janela deslizante alternada. Se o construtor de IR assumir o template llama, quebra aqui."
  },
  "config": {
    "architectures": ["Gemma2ForCausalLM"],
